// SR 172.010.1 — Chapter 1b Consultation of the Parliamentary Committees responsible for Foreign Policy
// generated by src/parse.py. Do not edit by hand.

:NOTE
Inserted by No I of the O of 6 July 2016, in force since 1 Aug. 2016 (AS 2016 2641).
